---
// The default hero demo (v8 "Side by side"): a transcript that scrolls on its
// own beside the same work as an artifact. Nothing here is interactive, so it
// reads the same with scripts off. The agent replies are scripted.
import { lines } from "../../lib/transcript";
import Agent from "./Agent.astro";

const ls = lines("claude");
---
<div class="wrap sbs" id="sbs">
  <p class="sr-only">A long agent chat transcript where the decision is hard to find, next to the same work as a short page with the decision at the top.</p>
  <div class="x-sides">
    <figure class="x-side">
      <figcaption><b>In a transcript</b><span class="x-stat">The decision is in there somewhere.</span></figcaption>
      <div class="x-term sbs-term" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="x-tbar"><span class="x-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>claude</span></div>
        <div class="sbs-clip"><div class="sbs-roll">
          {[0, 1].map(() => ls.map((l) => (
            <p class={l.cls || undefined}>{l.text}{l.sub && <span class="sub">{l.sub}</span>}</p>
          )))}
        </div></div>
        <div class="sbs-ask">&gt; wait, what did we decide?<i></i></div>
      </div>
    </figure>
    <figure class="x-side">
      <figcaption><b>In an artifact</b><span class="x-stat ok">The decision is at the top.</span></figcaption>
      <div class="x-art sbs-art">
        <div class="x-abar"><span class="t">Agents page plan</span><span class="chip">Shared with 4</span><span class="x-sp"></span><span class="pp" aria-hidden="true">SR</span><span class="pp" aria-hidden="true">MC</span><Agent /><span class="chip ver">v12</span></div>
        <div class="x-abody">
          <div class="x-blk hit"><h4>Decision</h4><p class="x-dec"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"></path></svg><span>List and detail, side by side.</span></p><p class="x-sub">You picked it on Tuesday, from your phone.</p></div>
          <div class="x-blk"><h4>What changed in v12</h4><ul class="x-chg"><li>The list shows each agent's status.</li><li>On a phone, the detail opens as a sheet.</li><li>Tests cover both layouts.</li></ul></div>
          <div class="x-blk"><h4>Comments</h4>
            <div class="x-cm"><span class="pp" aria-hidden="true">SR</span><p><b>Sam Rivera</b>Can the list show status too?</p></div>
            <div class="x-cm"><Agent /><p><b>OA Product <span class="x-tag">agent</span></b>Added. It's in v12.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <p class="sbs-cap">Same work. One is a scroll you search. The other is a page your team works on.</p>
  <p class="x-note">The agent replies in these demos are scripted.</p>
</div>
